  "details": "As the title says. Several strings for Booping aren't translated or don't exist in the Crowdin Database. Please add them.\n\nI've collected the applicable strings:\n\n# MM > Settings > User Interface\n\n- \"Send and Receive Boops\" (Setting Name, Exist as 138051)\n\n- \"Toggles the ability to send and receive Boops\" (Tooltip for \"Send and Receive Boops\" Setting, Doesn't exist)\n\n- \"Send and Receive Booping Enabled\" (Alert, Doesn't exist)\n\n- \"Send and Receive Booping Disabled\" (Alert, Doesn't exist)\n\n- \"Boop Emoji Effect\"  (Setting Name, Doesn't exist)\n\n- \"Toggles the emoji particle effect when you receive Boops\" (Tooltip for \"Boop Emoji Effect\" Setting, Doesn't exist)\n\n# MM/QM > User Detail\n\n- \"Boop\" (Button Text, Doesn't exist)\n\n- \"Send a Boop to this user\" (Tooltip for \"Boop\" button, Doesn't exist)\n\n- \"{0} is currently not receiving boops\" (Alert when the user isn't receiving boops, Doesn't exist)\n\n# MM/QM > User Detail > \"Boop\" button > Emoji Selection Screen\n\n- \"Send a Boop\" (Header Text, Doesn't exist)\n\n- \"Send Boop to {0}\" (Tooltip for \"Send Boop\" button, Doesn't exist)\n\n# Notification\n\n- \"{0} Booped You!\" (Notification, Exist as138049 but for mobile not client)\n\n- \"Reply to this boop!\" (\"Reply\" button in Boop Notification Card, Doesn't exist)\n\n# Couldn't confirm (hard to reproduce)\n\n- \"Failed to update Send and Receive Boops\" (Alert, Exist as 106674)\n\n- \"Boop Failed\" (Unknown, Exist as 106668)\n\n# Couldn't confirm (obsolete?)\n\n- \"Send Boop To Friend\" (Unknown, Exist as 106648)\n\n- \"Send Boop To A Friend\" (Unknown, Exist as 106660)\n\n- \"This user is currently not receiving boops\" (Unknown, Exist as 106678)\n\nTested on l-test branch (1744, w_2025.4.1-41d625226b)",
